{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 24,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why, seeing times ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not hid from the Almighty, do they that know him not see his days?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Some",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " remove the landmarks: they violently take away flocks, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " feed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They drive away the ass of the fatherless, they take the widow's ox for a pledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They turn the needy out of the way: the poor of the earth hide themselves together.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wild asses in the desert, they go forth to their work; rising betimes for a prey: the wilderness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yieldeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " food for them ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " children.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They reap ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "every one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his corn in the field: and they gather the vintage of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They cause the naked to lodge without clothing, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they have",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no covering in the cold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are wet with the showers of the mountains, and embrace the rock for want of a shelter.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They pluck the fatherless from the breast, and take a pledge of the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They cause ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to go naked without clothing, and they take away the sheaf ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the hungry;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " make oil within their walls, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " tread ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wine-presses, and suffer thirst.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Men groan from out of the city, and the soul of the wounded crieth out: yet God layeth not folly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are of those that rebel against the light; they know not its ways, nor abide in its paths.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The murderer rising with the light killeth the poor and needy, and in the night is as a thief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The eye also of the adulterer waiteth for the twilight, saying, No eye shall see me: and disguiseth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " face.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the dark they dig through houses, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they had marked for themselves in the day-time: they know not the light.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the morning ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to them even as the shades of death: if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knoweth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they are in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the terrors of the shades of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " swift as the waters; their portion is cursed in the earth: he beholdeth not the way of the vineyards.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Drouth and heat consume the snow-waters: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so doth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the grave ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "those who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " have sinned.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The womb shall forget him; the worm shall feed sweetly on him; he shall be no more remembered; and wickedness shall be broken as a tree.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He oppresseth the barren ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " beareth not: and doeth not good to the widow.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He draweth also the mighty with his power: he riseth up, and no ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " is sure of life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " it is given him ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in safety, on which he resteth; yet his eyes ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon their ways.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are exalted for a little while, but are gone and brought low; they are taken out of the way as all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "others",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and cut off as the tops of the ears of corn.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.24.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.24.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " now, who will make me a liar, and make my speech of no worth?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
